+| rank | variant | rmse | delta vs all | planted |w| in group |
+|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1 | drop_g3 | 1.9097 | +1.5896 | 2.0 |
+| 2 | drop_g0 | 1.5468 | +1.2267 | 1.5 |
